  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.BNBChainOASIS v2.0.5\n\nConnects the OASIS to BNB Chain (Binance Smart Chain) -- a high-performance EVM-compatible blockchain with 3-second blocks and minimal transaction fees. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and BEP-20/BEP-721 tokens. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- Add native CQL balance profiles for Base Avalanche and BNB Chain (e4da3c4)\n- Fix BNB Chain V2 query authority and encryption chain identity (3a4bda6)\n- Integrate verified BNB Smart Chain native storage (0c28102)\n- Integrate verified native BNB BootLoader registration (c6bcd75)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.BNBChainOASIS",
